@page "/platform"
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "The Serga platform"; ViewData["Description"] = "Independently useful. Better together. Shared business context across four Serga products."; }
<section class="hero container detail-hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">The Serga platform</p><h1>Independently useful.<br /><em>Better together.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Four connected business applications. One shared foundation for the customers, suppliers, people and locations behind your business.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="/contact">Book a demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/platform">Explore the platform <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

<partial name="_Platform" />

<section class="detail-section container"><div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Shared business context</p><h2>Relationships.<br /><em>Not isolated records.</em></h2><p>Serga connects the records normally separated across spreadsheets, contracts, ERP, CRM, email and individual knowledge.</p></div><div class="capability-grid"><article><h3>Organizations & people</h3><p>Customers, suppliers and providers, with the people and locations that define each relationship.</p></article><article><h3>Agreements, services & assets</h3><p>An agreement can relate to revenue, services or equipment. A subscription belongs to a customer; a leased asset to a location and agreement.</p></article><article><h3>Documents & workflows</h3><p>Documents, workflows and notifications keep decisions connected to the records and responsibilities behind them.</p></article></div></section>

<section class="detail-section container"><div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">One possible connection</p><h2>A service request.<br /><em>A wider relationship.</em></h2><p>An example of optional value together. A software company can use Revenue alone, and a property operator can use Services alone. No other Serga product is a prerequisite.</p></div><ol class="workflow"><li><span class="eyebrow">01</span><strong>Service requested</strong><p>A customer orders Internet access through Services.</p></li><li><span class="eyebrow">02</span><strong>Commercial relationship</strong><p>Revenue can hold the recurring subscription terms when needed.</p></li><li><span class="eyebrow">03</span><strong>Agreement context</strong><p>Contracts can add the covering agreement and obligations.</p></li></ol></section>

<partial name="_Integrations" />

<section class="final-cta"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Make the connection</p><h2>One shared foundation.<br /><em>Your choice of products.</em></h2><a class="button button-light" href="/contact">Book a demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="cta-tagline">Your gateway to services</span></div></section>
